BetterNuvio
===========

Independence
------------
BetterNuvio is an unofficial, independent desktop media client inspired by the feature set of
Nuvio Desktop (https://github.com/NuvioMedia/NuvioDesktop).

This repository does not contain code copied from Nuvio Desktop. It is a separate
implementation written in Rust and TypeScript. Nuvio Desktop is licensed under GPL-3.0; that
license applies to Nuvio Desktop, not to this independent work. No Nuvio Desktop binaries,
assets, or source files are redistributed here.

