changed.

Content and services
--------------------
BetterNuvio ships no media, no catalogs and no scrapers. All metadata, catalogs and streams come
from third-party addon URLs that the user installs, or from TMDB when the user supplies a key.
Users are responsible for the addons they configure and for complying with the laws that apply
to them.

Addon protocol
--------------
The addon transport implemented here follows the publicly documented Stremio addon protocol.
Stremio is a trademark of its respective owner; this project is not affiliated with Stremio.

Third-party services
--------------------
- TMDB: this product uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB.
- mpv: playback is performed by mpv (GPL-2.0-or-later), which is installed separately and is not
  bundled with this repository.

Third-party crates and npm packages are used under their own licenses; see `Cargo.lock` and
`bun.lock` for the exact set.
